    "enUS": {
      "description": "Here's the blade. You said that a paladin named Trevan sent you? Please extend my thanks to him for this opportunity when you next see him. Go with honor, friend.",
      "dialogue": {
        "181f622907472de8a3aa": "Here's the blade. You said that a paladin named Trevan sent you? Please extend my thanks to him for this opportunity when you next see him. Go with honor, friend.",
        "a003392eabb662213ab3": "<Trevan takes the blade and inspects it carefully.>\n\nThis will do nicely, $n. I knew that Ott had it in him to make something truly great.\n\nThe only thing left now is to kill that beast. Speak with Lumina when you are ready.",
        "e69b6fd098710423d5fb": "Was Ott able to carry out the commission?"
      },
      "summary": "Bring Ott's Masterwork to Trevan Rol in Silverpine Forest.",
      "title": "The Moonsilver Blade",
